            "notes": "The main strategy of this deck is to overwhelm the opponent with a constant stream of creatures and removal spells, while also utilizing sacrifice and graveyard recursion synergies to generate incremental value. The inclusion of various low-cost creatures with disruptive abilities, such as Burglar Rat and Plaguecrafter, helps disrupt the opponent's game plan while building towards a powerful board presence. The deck also takes advantage of Gorex, the Tombshell's ability to sacrifice creatures for additional value, further enhancing its aggro potential. With a focus on controlling the board and out-valuing the opponent through efficient removal, card advantage, and graveyard recursion, this deck aims to maintain constant pressure and force the opponent onto the back foot."
